@startuml state-match
title State Machine: Match (authority: Match Server; mirrored status in Backend) [v0.3.1]
[*] --> ALLOCATING : Backend creates match
ALLOCATING --> WAITING_FOR_PLAYERS : AssignAck (via heartbeat)
ALLOCATING --> ABORTED : assign failed / timeout
WAITING_FOR_PLAYERS --> READY : all competitors connected\nor join timeout + no-show rule [TBD]
WAITING_FOR_PLAYERS --> CANCELLED : < 2 competitors present [TBD OQ-GP-17]
READY --> LAUNCH_WINDOW : 1.5 s cue [P, OQ-LN-01]
LAUNCH_WINDOW --> RELEASE : exactly 5.000 s elapsed [C]
RELEASE --> BATTLE : 0.5 s, launch results broadcast
state BATTLE {
  [*] --> OPENING
  OPENING --> RUNNING : 3 s (skills locked)
  RUNNING --> RUNNING : tick / collisions / skills / eliminations
  RUNNING --> SUDDEN_DEATH : time limit [TBD OQ-GP-18]
}
BATTLE --> ENDED : remaining competitors <= 1
ENDED --> COMPLETED : result accepted by Backend
ENDED --> DISPUTED : result rejected by validation
READY --> ABORTED : server failure
LAUNCH_WINDOW --> ABORTED : server failure
BATTLE --> ABORTED : server failure (BR-013)
WAITING_FOR_PLAYERS --> ABORTED : server failure
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
ABORTED --> [*]
DISPUTED --> [*] : resolved by admin
note right of BATTLE
  Per-Bey states: state-bey-combat.puml
  Eliminations: BURST (primary) | OVER | XTREME | SPIN
end note
@enduml
